e_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nQO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c38ad69-461f-45ae-bcdc-803712a7cd5d","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ただウィンドウの壁を越えられないのは私がGUIのEmacsを想定していたからで、もしかしたらCUIならできるかもしれない\n(CUIだと、画面のUI部品として区切れてるわけではないので)","ts":"1617804967.075500","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1617804998.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+P3J3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d64b5299-d7fe-4462-81c7-2b6d3588568a","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"popup-elだとウィンドウの壁を越えられないんですよね。。fzf-previewみたいな表示はできなさそう。","ts":"1617804864.075300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z02A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C4F6CE94-118C-45A0-A14E-FF5DB09CA4DF","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ターミナル環境だと、popup-el が一番まともに表示できる印象ですね","ts":"1617801172.074900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yahari","count":1,"users":["U012MBD7MFZ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/uTyd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43ac8547-73e8-4e5f-8b3f-d1869dcb7608","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"pos-tip は明日試してみたいです","ts":"1617801089.073200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MHYRD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9c77a93-3564-4597-9536-bab7d0bf6b50","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"meta キーが効かなかったり、 Evil のクリップボードが使えなかったり\nposframe も無いですし、ちょっと辛いです","ts":"1617801012.072800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zcS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd1561e2-cab4-4578-b89b-a74640ab8af6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Vimと違ってGUIとTUIの機能が剥離しすぎている印象がある","ts":"1617800928.071900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zrT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38874E03-AC2D-4D9A-9855-D9BD1FF13BD2","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"Emacs にはPos Tip というUIもありますね。\n\u003chttps://www.emacswiki.org/emacs/PosTip|https://www.emacswiki.org/emacs/PosTip\u003e","ts":"1617800849.071400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IAOv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ed8d55d-890e-4de8-a1dd-4ede525a6b9e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Emacs、ターミナルで使うべきではないまであるイメージ","ts":"1617800841.071300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["U012MBD7MFZ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1v="}]},{"client_msg_id":"76994451-da8d-4eb2-82dd-2c6567b9dee6","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"tooltip ……何となくターミナルでは出なさそう？","ts":"1617800816.070700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=x1ra"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc5ca75b-a1c1-42c8-8336-adaf9509a396","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"NeoVim の floating window (fzf-preview が表示されている部分) を表現したかったです。\nそして……いつも丁寧にありがとうございます m(_ _)m !!","ts":"1617800795.069700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C+H3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"674b07db-e36b-4e88-a8c2-c3850d4529d8","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"tooltipというUI要素もあって、これはウィンドウの壁を越えられるんですよね。。\nこれとposframeの使い分けとなると難しいかもしれません。\n\u003chttps://www.emacswiki.org/emacs/PosTip\u003e","ts":"1617800170.068200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uvzO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"817a732f-a7d8-4a39-ab81-21300abb2402","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あ、記憶違いでした。\npopupはauto-completeの補完表示ですね。これはバッファの文字を変えてウィンドウっぽいものを表示しているので、バッファの壁を越えられません。\nposframeは違うフレームなので、下がどんなウィンドウ構成になっているかは関係ないという違いがあります。","ts":"1617800042.068000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U012MBD7MFZ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VIx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58d4d7da-99f5-42c5-9b5b-80b452c69c86","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"またまたfloating windowというのが何を指しているのか分からないのですが、とりあえずpopup.elはposframe代わりにはならないですね。\npopupはあらかじめ指定したところにウィンドウを開くパッケージです。(フレームは開きません)","ts":"1617799912.067800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K1OQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd9288c7-22e5-409d-a535-6e221a5d6f67","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"いえいえー。ちらみ機能使ったことないのでピンとこなかっただけでした()","ts":"1617799837.067600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kOqs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c3627d0-c73a-4da4-a7a2-b5a02d1b9e46","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/auto-complete/popup-el|popup.el\u003e が近いと思うのですが、あれは posframe 替わりにはならないのでしょうか？","ts":"1617799428.067200","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: auto-complete/popup-el","id":1,"title":"auto-complete/popup-el","title_link":"https://github.com/auto-complete/popup-el","text":"Visual Popup Interface Library for Emacs. Contribute to auto-complete/popup-el development by creating an account on GitHub.","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2239511?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":400,"thumb_height":400,"from_url":"https://github.com/auto-complete/popup-el","original_url":"https://github.com/auto-complete/popup-el"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/cH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54cb95b6-8e43-4758-bdfd-e75fa7d1af2c","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"Emacs のターミナルでも floating window 欲しいな〜。。","ts":"1617799309.066500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S++"}]},{"client_msg_id":"583ffc54-55ec-4210-94a0-6bcdf9207f07","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"はい、それ (\u003chttps://oremacs.com/swiper/#key-bindings-for-multiple-selections-and-actions-keep-minibuffer-open|ivy-call\u003e) です。紛らわしくてすみません m(_ _)m","ts":"1617799177.066000","edited":{"user":"U012MBD7MFZ","ts":"1617799210.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C1D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29c85552-e67d-4b24-860f-607d71604974","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"これはhelmですが、ivyにも対応する機能があるはず","ts":"1617797600.065000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pckwG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b6f824f-b43f-466e-95ee-e5ef67a12b00","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://syohex.hatenablog.com/entry/20121224/1356330903\u003e","ts":"1617797587.064700","attachments":[{"fallback":"syohex’s diary: helm(anything)をより便利に使う tips - syohex’s diary","id":1,"title":"helm(anything)をより便利に使う tips - syohex’s diary","title_link":"https://syohex.hatenablog.com/entry/20121224/1356330903","text":"この記事は Emacs Advent Calendar 2012の 24日目の記事です。 今日は helm(anything)を使いこなすというかより便利に使うための tipsを紹介します。 アクションを使いこなす helm(anything)は通常であればデフォルトアクションと呼ばれる 最も期待する動作を実行しますが、sourceによっては様々な actionが設定されており、一つのコマンドから様々なことが 行えます。 アクションは各種 helm(anything)コマンドを実行後 TABを押すことで 表示することができます。 例えば helm-find-filesのコマンドの場合は以下のよ…","image_url":"http://cdn-ak.f.st-hatena.com/images/fotolife/s/syohex/20121224/20121224145258.png","blocks":null,"ts":1356330903,"service_name":"syohex’s diary","service_icon":"https://syohex.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://syohex.hatenablog.com/entry/20121224/1356330903","original_url":"https://syohex.hatenablog.com/entry/20121224/1356330903"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,